                        </li>
                        <li role="none">
                            <a href="analyzeg-faq.html" role="menuitem">FAQ</a>
                        </li>
                        <li role="none">
                            <a href="#b2b-pricing" role="menuitem">Pricing</a>
                        </li>
                        <li role="none">
                            <a href="https://app.analyzeg.co.in/" data-app-href="/" class="nav-cta" role="menuitem" rel="noopener">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-4"/><polyline points="10 17 15 12 10 7"/><line x1="15" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"/></svg>
                                Launch App
                            </a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </nav>
            </div>
        </header>
        <main id="main-content">
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="hero" style="background-color: #1a1a2e;">
            <div class="hero-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="container">
                <!-- Single JTBD hero: B2B primary (brand intelligence), B2C secondary band -->
                <div class="hero-content" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <h1 style="font-size:2.9rem; font-weight:800; line-height:1.15; letter-spacing:-0.02em; color:#fff; text-shadow:0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.55), 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);" class="hero-title">Verified Video Review Intelligence for India's D2C &amp; Retail Brands</h1>
                        <p class="hero-tagline">
                            500 face-presence verified 30-second in-hand videos + Power BI dashboards + raw CSV/Excel with video links. Purchase available marketplace inventory in minutes; confirm custom requests before collection begins.
                        </p>
                        <p style="font-size:0.88rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9); margin-top:0.6rem; max-width:680px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto; line-height:1.5;">Buy verified reviews already available in the AnalyzeG marketplace. Delivery is near-instant for in-stock datasets; requests requiring new collection or custom quotas are confirmed before purchase and delivered within the agreed SLA.</p>
                        <p style="font-size:0.8rem; opacity:0.85; margin-top:0.6rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);">5-point review screening: face-presence, device, geo, content, timestamp + human moderation. <a href="/trust.html#verification" style="color:#93c5fd; text-decoration:underline;">How verification works</a> • <a href="/trust.html#inventory" style="color:#93c5fd; text-decoration:underline;">View available categories and sample inventory →</a></p>
                        <div class="hero-cta">
                            <a href="#b2b-pricing" class="btn-primary">Browse Review Inventory →</a>
                            <a href="/sample-analyzeg-reviews.csv" download class="btn-secondary" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);">Download Sample Data</a>
                            <a href="https://cal.com/analyzeg-demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-secondary">Book 15-min Demo</a>
                        </div>
                        <!-- Reviewer bridge — single subtle link (B2B primary, no payout number) -->
                        <div style="margin-top:1.4rem; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:0.5rem; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.13); border-radius:9999px; padding:0.55rem 1rem; backdrop-filter: blur(8px);">
                            <span style="font-size:0.82rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);">Have a product experience to share?</span>
                            <a href="/for-reviewers/" style="font-size:0.82rem; color:#fde68a; text-decoration:underline; font-weight:600;">Join the AnalyzeG reviewer community →</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <!-- Sticky mobile CTA — B2B primary (brand pricing) -->
        <div class="sticky-cta" style="display:none; position:fixed; bottom:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:999; background:#fff; border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0; box-shadow:0 -4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); padding:0.75rem 1rem; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:0.75rem;">
            <div style="min-width:0;"><div style="font-size:0.95rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; white-space:nowrap;">500 Videos • Power BI • 24h</div><div style="font-size:0.75rem; color:#475569;">GST Invoice • From ₹5L</div></div>
            <a href="#b2b-pricing" style="flex-shrink:0; background:#2563EB; color:#fff; padding:0.7rem 1.25rem; border-radius:9999px; font-weight:700; font-size:0.9rem; text-decoration:none;">View Pricing →</a>
        </div>
        <style>
            @media (max-width: 768px) { .sticky-cta { display:flex !important; } body { padding-bottom: 72px; } }
            @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) { .sticky-cta { animation: slideUp 0.4s ease-out; } @keyframes slideUp { from{transform:translateY(100%)} to{transform:translateY(0)} } }
        </style>
        <!-- Brand trust marquee — B2B primary -->
        <TrustMarquee client:load audience="brand" />
        <HowItWorks />

        <!-- B2B Pain Point Comparison: visible above fold per 2026 best practice -->
        <section class="pain-point-comparison" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #e3e7ef 100%); padding: 40px 0;">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="section-title" data-aos="fade-up" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Traditional Market Research Takes Months. You Need Answers Today.</h2>
                <p style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 3rem; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #475569;">Stop losing competitive advantage while waiting for outdated research methods</p>
                
                <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 3rem; margin-top: 3rem;">
                    <div data-aos="fade-right" style="background: white; border-radius: 16px; padding: 2.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border: 2px solid #fee2e2;">
                        <div style="background: #fee2e2; color: #dc2626; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">❌ The Old Way</div>
                        <h3 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: #1e293b;">Traditional Research Agencies</h3>
                        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
                            <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; color: #475569;"><strong style="color: #1e293b;">Timeline:</strong> 3-6 months for results</li>
                            <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; color: #475569;"><strong style="color: #1e293b;">Cost:</strong> ₹10-25 lakhs minimum</li>
                            <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; color: #475569;"><strong style="color: #1e293b;">Deliverables:</strong> 100-page PDF report</li>
                            <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; color: #475569;"><strong style="color: #1e293b;">Video Access:</strong> Pay extra (₹2-5 lakhs)</li>
                            <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; color: #475569;"><strong style="color: #1e293b;">Raw Data:</strong> Usually not provided</li>
                            <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; color: #475569;"><strong style="color: #1e293b;">Flexibility:</strong> Locked into scope</li>
                            <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; color: #475569;"><strong style="color: #1e293b;">Speed to Decision:</strong> Months of waiting</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div data-aos="fade-left" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563EB 0%, #1e40af 100%); border-radius: 16px; padding: 2.5rem; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(37,99,235,0.3); position: relative;">
                        <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); color: white; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">✅ The AnalyzeG Advantage</div>
                        <h3 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: white;">Real Video Reviews with Complete Analytics</h3>
                        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
                            <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);"><strong style="color: white;">Timeline:</strong> 2 minutes - 24 hours delivery</li>
                            <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);"><strong style="color: white;">Cost:</strong> ₹5-15 lakhs (500-1500 reviews)</li>
                            <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);"><strong style="color: white;">Deliverables:</strong> Power BI dashboard + custom template</li>
                            <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);"><strong style="color: white;">Video Access:</strong> 30-sec in-hand product videos</li>
                            <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);"><strong style="color: white;">Raw Data:</strong> Secure video access links + raw CSV/Excel with role-based controls</li>
