                            <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);"><strong style="color: white;">Purchase:</strong> One-time dataset licensing — repeat purchase available</li>
                        </ul>
                        <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; border-left: 4px solid #fbbf24;">
